<title>JAPAN: Japan 10-yr JGB auction lowest price 100.40 - MOF.</title>
<headline>Japan 10-yr JGB auction lowest price 100.40 - MOF.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Ministry of Finance (MOF) said the results of its 2.6 percent 10-year Japanese government bond (JGB) auction on Tuesday were as follows:</p>
<p> Lowest price	 100.40   Stop rate     2.549 pct</p>
<p> Average price	100.45   Average yield 2.543 pct</p>
<p> Total bids	   2.685  trillion yen</p>
<p> Accepted bids	590.79 billion yen</p>
<p> Bids accepted at lowest price 35.9010 pct</p>
<p> Issue date   March 21, 1997   Maturity   March 20, 2007</p>
</text>
